 детали обсуждаются при встречи.", "price_amt": "3750895132", "sq_price_amt": 622060.0, "url_txt": "https://www.cian.ru/sale/commercial/321842818/", "year_built": "", "ad_dttm": "2025-11-18T00:55:30", "create_dttm": "2025-09-15T12:00:01.253", "city_nm": "г Москва", "latitude": "55.7497897", "longitude": "37.5165308"}
