ных зданий. \nIDs: 7765,  ПС: 3431, IDp: 35485.", "price_amt": "999708814", "sq_price_amt": 226939.0, "url_txt": "https://www.cian.ru/sale/commercial/322440933/", "year_built": "", "ad_dttm": "2025-11-18T15:55:57", "create_dttm": "2025-10-01T14:00:02.067", "city_nm": "г Москва", "latitude": "55.7158807", "longitude": "37.6928651"}
