су, видеотур.", "price_amt": "35116200", "sq_price_amt": 41472.0, "url_txt": "https://www.cian.ru/rent/commercial/323770815/", "year_built": "2014", "ad_dttm": "2025-11-18T18:51:49", "create_dttm": "2025-11-10T19:02:29.95", "city_nm": "г Санкт-Петербург", "latitude": "59.9360563", "longitude": "30.3145939"}
